WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.030
Two identical cylinders of potato.

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.090
Put one in pure water,
and it gets heavier.

3
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:10.530
Put the other in a strong sugar
solution, and it gets lighter.

4
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.470
Suppose only water moved in or out.

5
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.390
Why would water move into one
piece, and out of the other?

6
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.210
In this mission, you'll meet osmosis:

7
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.550
the movement of water across
a membrane that lets only some

8
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.730
molecules through.

9
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.030
You'll see what happens to
cells in solutions of different

10
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:28.530
strengths.

11
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.730
And you'll compare
osmosis with diffusion,

12
00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:35.890
and with active transport,
the one that needs energy.

13
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.350
Your mission: explain why one
potato gains mass and one loses

14
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.210
it.
